Source landscape: Discovery reached 30 distinct candidates across official presidential communications, executive agencies, Congress, courts/audit repositories, investigative journalism, fact-checking organizations, academic work, and local-language/third-party material. The strongest source families concern truth and misinformation, campaign-finance-linked appointments, sugar-importation decisions, confidential funds, Maharlika, asset declarations, and institutional accountability. Search results were treated as leads only; no claims or judgments were extracted. Rappler was identified as access-blocked by robots.txt.

